1
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:22,070
The Story of Chu Dong Tu and Princess Tien Dung.

2
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:51,100
During King Hung the 18th, at Chu Xa village by Red River, there was a young man named Chu Dong Tu.

3
00:00:52,050 --> 00:01:08,520
Poor house, mother died early, father and son only had one shirt to share.

4
00:01:09,550 --> 00:01:27,650
When father died, son loved father so wrapped shirt to bury father, he himself had nothing to wear.

5
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:47,450
One day, while catching fish under river, he saw a large and luxurious boat coming gradually.

6
00:01:48,750 --> 00:02:02,000
That was Princess Tien Dung's boat, King Hung's daughter on tour.

7
00:02:02,950 --> 00:02:19,950
Young man panicked, ran to sparse tamarisk grove on beach, lay down, covered himself with sand to hide.

8
00:02:21,270 --> 00:02:41,050
Unexpectedly, princess saw beautiful scenery, ordered boat to dock, went ashore to stroll then ordered curtain set up at tamarisk grove to bathe.

9
00:02:42,370 --> 00:02:55,800
Bathing water washed sand away, revealing a strong young man.

10
00:02:56,900 --> 00:03:03,820
Princess was very shocked.

11
00:03:04,550 --> 00:03:17,900
But when knowing young man's family situation, she was very moved

12
00:03:17,900 --> 00:03:35,700
But when knowing young man's family situation, she was very moved and thought it was heaven-arranged fate, immediately held celebration and married him.

13
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:53,520
After that, couple Chu Dong Tu did not go to capital but went to find teacher to learn

14
00:03:53,520 --> 00:04:11,920
After that, couple Chu Dong Tu did not go to capital but went to find teacher to learn and went everywhere teaching people how to grow rice, raise silkworm, weave cloth.

15
00:04:14,050 --> 00:04:22,720
Finally, both ascended to heaven.

16
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:37,250
After ascending to heaven, Chu Dong Tu still many times appeared with magic to help people fight invaders.

